    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>奇物，珍稀（需同調）</em> <br />這件深色的、帶兜帽的厚布斗篷充斥着祕密和欺瞞的魔法。着裝它時，你可以獲得以下增益：<br /><em><strong>黑暗視覺Darkvision。</strong></em>你獲得60尺黑暗視覺&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]。如果你已經擁有黑暗視覺&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]，它會將你的黑暗視覺&amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]範圍增加60尺。<br /><em><strong>陰影移動Move in Shadows。</strong></em>若你身處處於微光光照&amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light}或黑暗中，你便可以用一個附贈動作，將你和你所穿着或攜帶的任何物品一起傳送到30尺內的可見未被佔據的微光光照&amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light}或黑暗空間中。隨後直至你本回合結束前，你下一次發動近戰攻擊時具有優勢。<br /><em><strong>刻意樹敵Willful Enmity。</strong></em>你可以從斗篷施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.VPJpFGhhBofVfsku]{敵意術 Antagonize}</em>（豁免DC15）（見第7章）。此法術一經斗篷施放，直到下次黎明前不能再次以此法施放該法術。</p><p>This dark, hooded mantle of thick cloth is infused with secretive and deceptive magic. While wearing it, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul class=\"rd__list rd__list-hang-notitle\"><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Darkvision\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Darkvision.</span> You gain &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] within a range of 60 feet. If you already have &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision], the mantle increases your &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision]'s range by 60 feet instead.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Move in Shadows\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Move in Shadows.</span> While you are in &amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light} or darkness, you can use a bonus action to teleport, along with anything you are wearing or carrying, up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see that is also in &amp;Reference[rule=dimlight]{dim light} or darkness. You then have advantage on the first melee attack you make before the end of the turn.</p></li><li class=\"rd__li \"><p class=\"rd__p-list-item\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Willful Enmity\"><span class=\"bold rd__list-item-name\">Willful Enmity.</span> You can cast the @spell[Antagonize|BMT] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from the mantle. Once the mantle has cast the spell, it can't cast the spell again until the next dawn.</p></li></ul></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
